<title>USA: Congo buys 13,389 tonnes PL 480 U.S. rice.</title>
<headline>Congo buys 13,389 tonnes PL 480 U.S. rice.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Congo bought Thursday 13,389 tonnes U.S. long-grain milled rice, 20 percent broken, under PL-480 export program, U.S. exporters and rice sources said.</p>
<p>The deal included 7,089 tonnes from Continental Grain at $375.44 a tonne, free alongside (FAS), 3,150 tonnes from Louis Dreyfus at $374.39 and three lots of 1,050 tonnes from Premium Rice, each at $362.53, $368.83 and $372.35.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for November 5-20 out of Houston and Lake Charles, La..</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
